error[L0404]: `not-a-key` does not implement `ord`
 --> check/sorted_map_key_not_ord.rslisp:6:17
  |
6 |     (sorted-map (new not-a-key (name (str "x")))
  |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this needs `ord`
