  = note: `ord` is never inferred for a struct, so the struct needs a written `derive`
  = help: add `(derive not-a-key clone partial-eq eq hash show ord)` to compare fields in this order: `name`
  = help: to sort by one field instead, use `sort-by!` with the field keyword `:name`
